RULES (libcqops CLAUDE.md, "Key Prohibitions")
----------------------------------------------
  * This file is a VERBATIM MIRROR of a FROZEN ABI. NEVER edit it here.
  * To pick up an ABI change, re-copy from CQ_lang at a NEW pinned revision
    and record it, as this file records this one. Do not hand-patch.
  * CQ_lang is a separate repository and is READ-ONLY from libcqops.
  * cmake/CqopsIntrinsicPin.cmake's `cqops_check_opcode_pin` makes the
    sha256 above a CONFIGURE-TIME hard error, on the shape of
    COMMIT.intrinsics's two arms. Its label, `opcode-sha256`, is a string
    neither of those arms matches. cmake/CqopsLinkWitness.cmake's R3 arm
    also requires tests/abi/cq_templates_abi.txt's `yaml-sha256` line to
    equal the yaml's sha256.

